  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner Identification for Ndola project group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this partner identification, we will visit the youth and young adult leadership in Openchurch Ndola in Zambia to meet and discuss how a potential partnership could look and be about.  We want this partner identification to be a starting point for a potential partnership. So far, we have only talked a couple of times over Zoom. We hope that meeting face to face and seeing the facilities, meeting the people and talking about values, dreams and desires for a potential future project will help us identify whether or not we are a good match. Hopefully, meeting with the young people and the leaders will create a clearer vision and a good foundation for an international partnership.</narrative>
  </description>
